                    "message": "Yes we need it to avoid the lambda from reformatting.\n\nCurrently we have\n```\ntimer.async_wait( ...\n```\nbut\n```\npropertiesChangedTimer.async_wait( ...\n```\n\nwould cause a different indentation for the whole lambda body."
